{"severity":"error","file":"errors/cap_result_unhandled_4.march","start_line":9,"start_col":10,"end_line":9,"end_col":29,"message":"This capability operation returns `Result(Option(String), CapError)`, which says whether it was permitted, but `Option(String)` is expected here.","code":"cap_result_unhandled","fix":{"kind":"replace","start_line":9,"start_col":10,"end_line":9,"end_col":29,"text":"Authority.must(Process.env(\"HOME\"))","applicability":"machine-applicable"},"labels":[],"notes":["Handle the refusal (`match`, `let?`), or write `Authority.must(...)` to take the value and panic if the operation is refused."],"category":"CAPABILITY"}
